    "description": "Full structured spatial anchor; overrides lat/lon and place. `fictional` carries the narrative value only \u2014 a fictional place never resolves to coordinates (the chart reads on the planetary layer, houseless), by design"
   },
   "zodiac": {
    "default": "tropical",
